            "review_title": "Review at Buffet Cuu Van Long Premium",
            "review_text": "Yann P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam170 contributions\n0\nIncredible seafood buffet\nJan 2024 • Business\nSTAFF PARTY\nAmazing seafood & shells buffet, gorgeous variety (sushi, sashimi, crab, oyster, shrimps, octopus, shells, others)\nAsiatic stand\nStarters stand with a huge range of greens & salads\nGrilled meat with garnitures\nDeserts\nAll food is very fresh\n\nJust 2 points must be improved:\n* Grilled meats, limited, increase choice\n* Desserts more international (crepes, fruits fritter, choclate mousse, caramel flan)\n\nThe most important is you have a Good Value for Money\n\nContinue the prestation, NO decrease the quality\n\nFor me the BEST Destination in HCM\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 19, 2024",
